WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.004
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:19.274 --> 00:21.022
[The 8th Traditional Coming-of-Age Ceremony] Reaching adulthood,

3
00:21.022 --> 00:23.190
with an upright and calm body and mind,

4
00:23.190 --> 00:26.582
firm will and integrity, may you possess the virtues of a woman.

5
00:26.582 --> 00:29.766
You have reached adulthood as you insert this hairpin.

6
00:29.766 --> 00:32.978
May your body and mind be upright and pure,

7
00:32.978 --> 00:35.578
your will and integrity steadfast,

8
00:35.578 --> 00:40.138
and may you embody the virtues of a woman.

9
00:44.662 --> 00:50.878
This hairpin is the burden you must shoulder as a woman.

10
00:51.734 --> 00:58.034
From now on, you must stay modest and prudent in both body and mind.

11
00:58.034 --> 01:00.350
Do not show yourself easily

12
01:00.350 --> 01:02.970
or grant it rashly.

13
01:02.970 --> 01:05.774
Treasuring yourself preciously

14
01:05.774 --> 01:08.434
is the true grace of a woman.

15
01:08.434 --> 01:10.470
Do you understand?

16
01:10.470 --> 01:14.338
Only after 29 years did I pull out with my own hands

17
01:14.338 --> 01:18.948
my mother's hairpin that had weighed down my head all my life.

18
04:09.290 --> 04:13.708
When you fall in love, so much happens inside your brain.

19
04:15.818 --> 04:17.978
Shrimp? Chicken?

20
04:17.978 --> 04:21.968
Reason goes numb, and passion surges.

21
04:23.054 --> 04:26.398
One salmon sandwich and one warm hot coffee latte, please.

22
04:26.398 --> 04:29.666
One salmon sandwich and a latte...

23
04:29.666 --> 04:31.242
Will there be anything else?

24
04:31.242 --> 04:33.654
No, that's fine. Wait, maybe chicken is safer?

25
04:33.654 --> 04:35.706
Does the chicken sandwich come with avocado too?

26
04:35.706 --> 04:38.002
You have to add it. Would you like me to do that?

27
04:38.002 --> 04:40.058
Never mind. Just make it as original.

28
04:47.426 --> 04:49.738
Our activated nerves and brain

29
04:49.738 --> 04:53.394
assign positive value to the other person.

30
04:53.394 --> 04:57.878
They make them feel dazzlingly attractive and irresistible.

31
04:58.898 --> 05:04.118
Dopamine, serotonin, phenylethylamine, and oxytocin...

32
05:04.118 --> 05:08.448
When all these hormones surge at once,

33
05:08.448 --> 05:12.458
we call that love.

34
05:20.758 --> 05:22.490
Yeon Su,

35
05:22.490 --> 05:24.228
are you awake?

36
05:44.598 --> 05:47.198
[I had fun!]

37
06:22.834 --> 06:26.974
[Episode 7] Can you be friends after sex?

38
06:26.974 --> 06:29.798
Is this the opinion column for this week?

39
06:29.798 --> 06:33.762
Totally possible! Once you hit this age,

40
06:33.762 --> 06:36.102
everyone's basically a friend anyway.

41
06:36.102 --> 06:40.602
Come on! Sleeping together revokes friendship status. No way!

42
06:40.602 --> 06:44.734
Throw away the prejudice that friends are formed solely by friendship.

43
06:44.734 --> 06:47.138
Ever heard of FWB?

44
06:47.138 --> 06:48.442
FW what?

45
06:48.442 --> 06:50.702
Friends with benefits.

46
06:50.702 --> 06:55.550
You know, casual friends who keep it purely physical.

47
06:55.550 --> 06:57.934
Look at you, Ms. Gong!

48
06:57.934 --> 07:01.255
Well, even I know that much.

49
07:02.541 --> 07:04.829
So, could you do it, Ms. Gong?

50
07:08.194 --> 07:10.269
It's... possible?

51
07:10.905 --> 07:12.550
Wait, really?

52
07:12.550 --> 07:15.878
I mean, as long as both agree,

53
07:15.878 --> 07:17.558
there's nothing wrong with it?

54
07:17.558 --> 07:20.690
Shall we say respecting the diversity of relationships?

55
07:20.690 --> 07:24.138
You are that kind of cool lady! What about you, boss?

56
07:24.138 --> 07:28.130
Sure. Isn't the whole point to have fun together?

57
07:28.130 --> 07:30.618
As long as it was fun, that's enough.

58
07:30.618 --> 07:33.334
- Exactly! - Right, having fun is what matters.

59
07:33.334 --> 07:36.446
- Then, let's start the meeting with fun. - Yes.

60
07:36.446 --> 07:39.994
Okay, first, the results from the pop-up.

61
07:39.994 --> 07:41.218
Ta-da!

62
07:41.218 --> 07:45.622
Sales during the event grew about twenty-five percent,

63
07:45.622 --> 07:48.582
and the online mall order rate immediately after the pop-up

64
07:48.582 --> 07:51.603
also increased by 12% compared to the previous month! Applause!

65
07:53.978 --> 07:58.046
And the number of new member sign-ups also shot up!

66
07:58.046 --> 08:03.218
But the downside is that the influx of weird customers has also increased a lot!

67
08:03.933 --> 08:05.166
He got triggered.

68
08:05.166 --> 08:09.130
That "I had fun" totally bruised his ego.

69
08:09.130 --> 08:11.034
It reads like a casual restaurant review.

70
08:12.381 --> 08:14.330
The more I think about it, the more ridiculous it is.

71
08:14.330 --> 08:17.709
Only his pride? Mine took a beating too!

72
08:24.926 --> 08:27.456
At least it's clean and neat...

73
08:33.098 --> 08:34.914
Still,

74
08:35.866 --> 08:38.246
leaving like this,

75
08:38.246 --> 08:40.354
isn't that a bit cold?

76
08:40.354 --> 08:42.282
He probably thought he was being polite,

77
08:42.282 --> 08:45.210
so you wouldn't feel awkward. I totally understand.

78
08:45.210 --> 08:48.658
Didn't you flip out when that younger guy bailed on you?

79
08:48.658 --> 08:50.650
Hey, that's completely different.

80
08:50.650 --> 08:53.281
You two work together.

81
08:54.466 --> 08:56.522
What should I do?

82
08:56.522 --> 08:59.826
Should I wait for him, or just leave?

83
09:01.021 --> 09:02.638
- Sera... - Yeah?

84
09:02.638 --> 09:04.958
I want to sound as sophisticated as possible.

85
09:04.958 --> 09:06.686
- Got a pen? - A pen?

86
09:06.686 --> 09:08.922
- Hold on. - Write this down.

87
09:10.050 --> 09:12.133
Okay, shoot.

88
09:14.374 --> 09:18.366
N-O-T... B... A-D?

89
09:18.366 --> 09:22.838
"Not bad"? That's way too much!

90
09:22.838 --> 09:24.686
How about this? FWB.

91
09:24.686 --> 09:26.102
FW what?

92
09:26.102 --> 09:30.886
Friends with benefits! Keeping it purely physical and casual.

93
09:30.886 --> 09:33.146
You want me to write that on the note?

94
09:33.146 --> 09:35.514
It's just three letters, how cool is that?

95
09:35.514 --> 09:37.854
I'm hanging up.

96
09:58.994 --> 10:01.433
[I had fun!]

97
10:24.640 --> 10:27.860
So, do you regret it?

98
10:30.698 --> 10:32.666
Are your feelings hurt?

99
10:32.666 --> 10:35.091
It's not that, but...

100
10:36.186 --> 10:38.494
Was it good?

101
10:38.494 --> 10:40.754
Come on, why are you asking?

102
10:40.754 --> 10:46.124
Tell me. It's the biggest milestone in Gong Yeon Su's life!

103
10:48.558 --> 10:50.442
I don't know.

104
10:54.230 --> 10:55.790
Why are you smiling?

105
10:55.790 --> 10:57.558
I'm not smiling.

106
10:59.805 --> 11:01.338
Look at you!

107
11:01.338 --> 11:03.914
What? Why?

108
11:03.914 --> 11:06.562
Wait, don't tell me...

109
11:06.562 --> 11:08.222
Fingers of truth.

110
11:08.222 --> 11:11.664
Why are we playing drinking games over salad?

111
11:13.966 --> 11:15.069
A finger down

112
11:15.069 --> 11:17.514
- if you can't stop thinking about him. - Stop it!

113
11:17.514 --> 11:19.786
- Fold it. - Happy now?

114
11:19.786 --> 11:21.890
Put a finger down if your heart races around him.

115
11:21.890 --> 11:24.098
I just have mild arrhythmia.

116
11:27.634 --> 11:32.732
If he asked to sleep together again, and you'd say yes, fold the rest.

117
11:34.346 --> 11:36.330
Cut it out, will you?

118
11:36.330 --> 11:38.146
So, you wouldn't?

119
11:41.086 --> 11:42.854
I would.

120
11:47.286 --> 11:48.942
Yeon Su,

121
11:48.942 --> 11:50.718
the thing is...

122
11:50.718 --> 11:53.711
he might just be looking for fun.

123
11:54.386 --> 11:56.256
Can you handle that?

124
12:04.846 --> 12:08.394
By the way, did Yeon Su say anything?

125
12:08.394 --> 12:10.834
- About what? - Well,

126
12:10.834 --> 12:12.734
she brought two guys home,

127
12:12.734 --> 12:15.566
yet she hasn't said a single word about either of them.

128
12:15.566 --> 12:18.570
So, who's your pick?

129
12:18.570 --> 12:20.514
Number one?

130
12:20.514 --> 12:22.450
Or number two?

131
12:22.450 --> 12:24.013
When all is said and done!

132
12:24.013 --> 12:27.578
A man must be sexy to be worth living with.

133
12:27.578 --> 12:29.206
Did you get divorced because your ex wasn't sexy?

134
12:29.206 --> 12:30.522
He was sexy.

135
12:30.522 --> 12:36.170
The problem was, other women found him sexy too.

136
12:36.878 --> 12:40.530
A man just needs to protect his own woman.

137
12:40.530 --> 12:45.254
A man who protects his woman will protect his family too.

138
12:45.254 --> 12:48.349
And... stay healthy.

139
12:51.898 --> 12:53.750
Seriously, come on!

140
12:53.750 --> 12:56.797
Store-bought dumplings are great these days.

141
12:56.797 --> 12:58.518
Why waste our valuable labor on this?

142
12:58.518 --> 13:03.446
I should bring the kimchi filling...

143
13:05.154 --> 13:07.739
I liked that boy.

144
13:10.386 --> 13:13.249
He reminds me of you when you were young.

145
13:27.938 --> 13:32.858
I'll take the next one.

146
13:32.858 --> 13:34.230
There's room for you.

147
13:34.230 --> 13:37.558
What? Wait...

148
13:40.890 --> 13:42.946
Did you enjoy your meal?

149
13:42.946 --> 13:45.281
Ah, yes...

150
14:01.998 --> 14:06.362
The thing is... he might just be looking for fun.

151
14:06.362 --> 14:08.311
Can you handle that?

152
14:18.160 --> 14:20.760
[You think I'm joking? I'm coming for you! CEO, I'll burst your balls!]

153
14:21.698 --> 14:25.374
What is all this?

154
14:25.374 --> 14:27.010
Thank you!

155
14:27.010 --> 14:28.470
What's up?

156
14:28.470 --> 14:31.382
Mr. Yoon, did you see the community board?

157
14:31.382 --> 14:34.866
Peter Panty? He's at it again?

158
14:34.866 --> 14:38.878
He just throws a fit whenever quarterly coupons drop. Ignore him.

159
14:38.878 --> 14:43.082
Still, the level of verbal abuse

160
14:43.082 --> 14:44.982
and threats is too strong.

161
14:44.982 --> 14:48.546
Here says, "coming to the company to set it on fire,

162
14:48.546 --> 14:50.446
grabbing the CEO by the collar,

163
14:50.446 --> 14:52.077
and that part...

164
14:52.914 --> 14:54.534
- He can't do that. - Why?

165
14:54.534 --> 14:56.382
- What else does it say? - It says...

166
14:56.382 --> 15:00.738
- Damage... his private area... - What?

167
15:00.738 --> 15:03.136
He says he'll chop it off!

168
15:04.786 --> 15:06.594
Chop what off?

169
15:06.594 --> 15:08.909
Peter Panty is throwing another fit.

170
15:08.909 --> 15:11.159
Looks like Ms. Yeon Su is worried about you.

171
15:14.550 --> 15:18.722
- Worried? - Well, my desk is closest to the entrance.

172
15:18.722 --> 15:23.306
If he storms in, I'd be the first to get hit.

173
15:23.306 --> 15:26.670
Why worry? You are the specialist for this.

174
15:26.670 --> 15:28.718
If something happens,

175
15:29.410 --> 15:31.186
you run away, no?

176
15:36.622 --> 15:38.978
Look who's talking!

177
15:41.757 --> 15:43.314
Ms. Yeon Su!

178
15:43.314 --> 15:44.594
Yes?

179
15:44.594 --> 15:46.319
Can you come out?

180
15:47.694 --> 15:50.210
Oh, it melted already.

181
15:50.210 --> 15:53.659
It's fine. Thanks for the drink.

182
16:02.734 --> 16:07.070
Actually, I called you over to ask you out.

183
16:07.070 --> 16:08.766
What are you doing tonight?

184
16:08.766 --> 16:12.220
I'm pretty tired today, so...

185
16:14.938 --> 16:16.450
What about tomorrow?

186
16:16.450 --> 16:19.266
Tomorrow, I have to help

187
16:19.266 --> 16:20.946
prepare for a memorial service at home.

188
16:22.685 --> 16:24.190
I see.

189
16:25.814 --> 16:28.134
Ms. Yeon Su,

190
16:28.134 --> 16:31.506
if I'm moving too fast, feel free to pull the brakes on me.

191
16:31.506 --> 16:33.302
Pardon?

192
16:34.446 --> 16:38.955
I like you so much that I might be rushing ahead without thinking.

193
16:40.578 --> 16:44.877
Let's get something delicious next week instead.

194
16:55.054 --> 16:57.515
Mr. Yoon...

195
17:00.274 --> 17:03.678
I don't think I can go on a date with you.

196
17:03.678 --> 17:07.417
Thank you for filling my heart with delicious food

197
17:07.417 --> 17:11.821
whenever things were hard or upsetting.

198
17:14.082 --> 17:16.534
But my feelings

199
17:17.554 --> 17:20.454
don't go beyond that.

200
17:23.378 --> 17:27.198
May I ask the reason?

201
17:27.198 --> 17:29.986
Am I just not your type?

202
17:29.986 --> 17:33.014
Or perhaps...

203
17:33.014 --> 17:36.012
is there someone you like?

204
17:44.658 --> 17:46.538
My feelings belong to me,

205
17:46.538 --> 17:49.108
and your feelings belong to you.

206
17:50.782 --> 17:54.405
Still, thank you. For being honest with me.

207
17:55.370 --> 17:57.458
Thank you too.

208
17:57.458 --> 17:59.638
Call me anytime if you're having a rough time.

209
17:59.638 --> 18:02.663
I'll treat you to tons of spicy udon.

210
18:53.234 --> 18:55.546
Your moves are sluggish, and your expression looks terrible.

211
18:55.546 --> 18:58.066
What's gotten into you lately?

212
18:58.066 --> 18:59.258
I'm sorry.

213
18:59.258 --> 19:00.618
Are you sick?

214
19:00.618 --> 19:04.570
Or have you checked out because you're moving somewhere?

215
19:04.570 --> 19:06.474
You're still on my team.

216
19:06.474 --> 19:08.813
Do your job right for the remaining performances.

217
19:26.733 --> 19:31.002
[Nam Su]

218
19:41.356 --> 19:43.248
[My Sini]

219
19:46.342 --> 19:48.134
The subscriber you dialed is unavailable...

220
19:49.885 --> 19:50.962
Come help me lift this!

221
19:50.962 --> 19:52.949
Yes, sir! Coming!

222
19:57.966 --> 20:00.622
Can you build a pyramid?

223
20:00.622 --> 20:02.970
What are you building right now?

224
20:02.970 --> 20:06.445
I'm building a pyramid.

225
20:08.806 --> 20:11.418
Long time no see, Mr. Yoon.

226
20:11.418 --> 20:14.250
He went to greet the family, but no news yet.

227
20:14.250 --> 20:15.906
He's been extremely busy.

228
20:15.906 --> 20:19.078
Do you know how embarrassing this is for me as the matchmaker?

229
20:19.078 --> 20:20.174
What are you talking about?

230
20:20.174 --> 20:24.162
If your son has such an issue, you should've told me earlier!

231
20:24.162 --> 20:25.930
An issue?

232
20:26.538 --> 20:27.754
What?

233
20:27.754 --> 20:29.667
What did you say?

234
20:32.818 --> 20:34.322
Why did you cook all this?

235
20:34.322 --> 20:36.206
I cook whenever I feel down.

236
20:36.206 --> 20:39.054
Just buy some bread instead. Why tire yourself out?

237
20:39.054 --> 20:40.946
I baked bread too.

238
20:43.726 --> 20:47.020
[Dad]

239
20:50.386 --> 20:54.106
Answer it. He keeps calling me because you won't pick up.

240
20:54.106 --> 20:55.254
Just block him.

241
20:55.254 --> 20:56.998
Gosh, such a brat!

242
20:56.998 --> 20:59.938
He only wants one thing: to set me up on a blind date.

243
20:59.938 --> 21:01.306
Not this time.

244
21:01.306 --> 21:03.418
He just asked how you are doing.

245
21:03.418 --> 21:06.650
Whether you're doing fine, whether you're seeing anyone.

246
21:06.650 --> 21:11.358
- Really? Stop taking his calls. - Then pick up your darn phone!

247
21:11.358 --> 21:12.542
What did you tell him?

248
21:12.542 --> 21:16.690
That you're fine and always seeing women.

249
21:18.682 --> 21:19.974
By the way,

250
21:19.974 --> 21:21.987
is he still pushing blind dates on you?

251
21:22.942 --> 21:25.991
Was the one with Ms. Yeon Su the last?

252
21:27.362 --> 21:30.458
I should've gone instead of you.

253
21:30.458 --> 21:33.368
Maybe things would've turned out differently

254
21:33.368 --> 21:35.626
if we'd met as prospective spouses.

255
21:36.610 --> 21:38.838
What do you mean?

256
21:39.530 --> 21:41.282
I got dumped.

257
21:41.282 --> 21:43.722
- By Yeon Su. - What?

258
21:43.722 --> 21:47.026
I'm pretty sure she has someone

259
21:47.026 --> 21:48.874
she likes.

260
21:52.221 --> 21:53.918
I still had so much charm to show her!

261
21:53.918 --> 21:57.736
What good is having an in-law-approved face when she cuts me off at the door?

262
21:57.736 --> 22:00.390
Forget it! Let's grab a beer.

263
22:00.390 --> 22:02.218
Sure.

264
22:12.078 --> 22:13.766
Great!

265
22:13.766 --> 22:15.834
- New clothes? - Had them already.

266
22:15.834 --> 22:19.146
- New skincare routine? - Same one I always use.

267
22:19.146 --> 22:21.194
Something feels different about you.

268
22:21.194 --> 22:23.048
Like what?

269
22:23.666 --> 22:26.410
Do I look more sophisticated?

270
22:26.410 --> 22:31.734
Your overall vibe feels subtly pumped up,

271
22:31.734 --> 22:35.978
like you're radiating positive male energy.

272
22:37.534 --> 22:38.638
Stop talking nonsense!

273
22:38.638 --> 22:41.186
Did something happen in Busan?

274
22:41.186 --> 22:43.278
What? N-N-Nothing happened!

275
22:43.278 --> 22:47.214
O-O-Oh? Why are you stammering so hard?

276
22:47.214 --> 22:50.370
I knew it! You...

277
22:51.858 --> 22:53.430
You did it, didn't you?

278
22:54.678 --> 22:56.618
- Seriously! - Wait, really? You really did it?

279
22:56.618 --> 22:58.126
- Did you actually do it? - Stop it!

280
22:58.126 --> 23:01.854
Auntie, keep your voice down! Everyone will hear!

281
23:01.854 --> 23:05.257
Finally! You actually did it!

282
23:07.218 --> 23:08.670
Where are our ancestors...

283
23:08.670 --> 23:10.606
Here... Dear ancestors!

284
23:10.606 --> 23:13.037
The eldest daughter of the Gong clan

285
23:13.037 --> 23:17.115
has finally unboxed her body!

286
23:18.238 --> 23:21.310
Stop it! Cut it out!

287
23:21.310 --> 23:22.710
Wait!

288
23:22.710 --> 23:26.834
- How was it? Amazing? Did you go to heaven? - I don't know!

289
23:26.834 --> 23:29.026
- Back off a little. - Come on!

290
23:29.026 --> 23:32.258
Give me a one-line review!

291
23:32.258 --> 23:34.690
Gosh, really!

292
23:34.690 --> 23:38.514
Why is everyone so obsessed with someone else's first time?

293
23:38.514 --> 23:40.259
First time?

294
23:46.238 --> 23:48.142
Don't tell me...

295
23:49.262 --> 23:51.220
You had sex?

296
23:52.090 --> 23:56.308
I was talking about using a sex toy!

297
23:56.934 --> 24:00.541
I... I was talking a-a-a-about that too!

298
24:00.541 --> 24:04.874
Oh, my! Oh, my goodness! Look at you!

299
24:04.874 --> 24:07.946
I can't believe this. Wow! Oh, my!

300
24:07.946 --> 24:12.077
It seems like just yesterday you were wearing squeaky shoes!

301
24:13.742 --> 24:16.161
You're all grown up now!

302
24:16.858 --> 24:18.706
Oh, dear...

303
24:19.882 --> 24:21.754
So, how was it?

304
24:21.754 --> 24:23.711
Nothing crazy once you actually do it, right?

305
24:26.954 --> 24:29.402
Acting like it's some big deal.

306
24:29.402 --> 24:34.313
Treating it like the ultimate forbidden fruit.

307
24:37.854 --> 24:41.542
Auntie, how did it feel for you?

308
24:41.542 --> 24:43.238
Did I feel it?

309
24:43.238 --> 24:48.277
No, I mean emotionally. Were you okay?

310
24:51.094 --> 24:52.698
Why?

311
24:52.698 --> 24:54.491
How did you feel?

312
24:56.278 --> 24:59.204
It just felt... weird.

313
25:00.094 --> 25:02.854
I wondered if it was okay,

314
25:02.854 --> 25:05.102
and then felt empty.

315
25:05.102 --> 25:10.206
Guilty, but also relieved at the same time.

316
25:12.214 --> 25:15.679
There's a word for that:

317
25:17.102 --> 25:21.018
bittersweet relief.

318
25:25.966 --> 25:27.614
It's not like you were defending a lifelong belief.

319
25:27.614 --> 25:31.403
You just kept a promise.

320
25:35.421 --> 25:40.621
Now let's each take care of our own lives.

321
25:42.758 --> 25:44.792
Come out and eat.

322
25:49.786 --> 25:52.058
So who was it? Number one or number two?

323
25:52.058 --> 25:54.510
Come on! Auntie!

324
25:55.622 --> 25:57.646
- Number three? - Stop it!

325
26:10.638 --> 26:13.986
Lately our eldest grandson is hard to see.

326
26:13.986 --> 26:15.949
He went out early again.

327
26:15.949 --> 26:18.518
I guess because the exam is right ahead, he's working hard.

328
26:18.518 --> 26:20.882
Oh, my...

329
26:20.882 --> 26:22.682
How admirable!

330
26:22.682 --> 26:24.205
There's not much time left.

331
26:24.205 --> 26:25.838
Since he'll definitely pass this time,

332
26:25.838 --> 26:27.650
just hang in there a bit more.

333
26:27.650 --> 26:28.822
Yes, of course.

334
26:28.822 --> 26:31.485
We'll see whether he passes or not.

335
26:31.485 --> 26:33.678
You never know with these things.

336
26:33.678 --> 26:39.418
You never know how it ends until the lid comes off.

337
26:39.418 --> 26:41.978
Isn't that right, Yeon Su?

338
26:44.306 --> 26:46.850
At least your niece and your nephew have lids to open.

339
26:46.850 --> 26:51.292
You're just a bottomless pit who runs her mouth and eats all day.

340
26:51.292 --> 26:52.810
Oh, dear...

341
26:52.810 --> 26:55.454
Let's get Nam Su some herbal tonic.

342
26:55.454 --> 26:59.130
He uses his brain all day, so he needs to replenish his energy.

343
26:59.130 --> 27:00.626
Yes.

344
27:00.626 --> 27:03.242
I'll get going to work now.

345
27:03.242 --> 27:05.664
- All right. - Thank you for the meal.

346
27:06.582 --> 27:08.308
Goodness!

347
27:15.046 --> 27:16.614
Yeon Su!

348
27:16.614 --> 27:18.650
Mom, why did you come out?

349
27:18.650 --> 27:20.618
Why are you leaving in the middle of eating?

350
27:20.618 --> 27:24.406
I'm running late. I'm full, so don't worry.

351
27:24.406 --> 27:26.950
Is everything all right with you lately?

352
27:29.406 --> 27:32.862
Yeah, nothing's wrong.

353
27:32.862 --> 27:35.990
Once Nam Su's exam is over, I'll get you some herbal tonic too.

354
27:35.990 --> 27:39.138
I haven't paid enough attention to you.

355
27:39.138 --> 27:41.794
I'm fine. Just take good care of Nam Su.

356
27:41.794 --> 27:44.498
He looked exhausted recently.

357
27:44.498 --> 27:48.221
You're still my pride and joy, Yeon Su.

358
27:48.221 --> 27:49.625
You know that, right?

359
27:57.778 --> 27:58.982
I'm late. See you!

360
27:59.677 --> 28:02.429
Have a good day at work!

361
28:12.664 --> 28:14.917
You'll bring the house down with that sigh.

362
28:14.917 --> 28:18.061
My heart is already buried in an underground bunker.

363
28:18.061 --> 28:20.166
I just can't shake this off.

364
28:20.166 --> 28:23.038
Stop it. It's not like she committed a crime or anything.

365
28:23.038 --> 28:25.014
You don't understand how I feel.

366
28:25.014 --> 28:29.038
You've never had a child or raised a daughter.

367
28:29.038 --> 28:30.330
Then tell me.

368
28:30.330 --> 28:32.450
Would you rather Ha Neul got pregnant by accident?

369
28:32.450 --> 28:36.354
What? Absolutely not!

370
28:36.354 --> 28:40.486
See? Considering that, the current situation isn't necessarily bad, right?

371
28:40.486 --> 28:43.402
How responsible is she, using contraception on her own?

372
28:43.402 --> 28:45.690
I know that too.

373
28:45.690 --> 28:47.994
I know all that, but...

374
28:47.994 --> 28:51.086
That's just how a mother feels.

375
28:51.086 --> 28:55.434
Even when she's thirty or forty, she's still my baby,

376
28:55.434 --> 28:58.354
and I just want her to stay my baby.

377
28:58.354 --> 29:00.320
Something like that.

378
29:06.218 --> 29:09.763
Watching my own child become independent...

379
29:10.910 --> 29:13.417
I guess I didn't want to accept it.

380
29:16.638 --> 29:18.540
[Mom]

381
29:25.062 --> 29:29.074
Okay, I admit it! I was being petty.

382
29:29.074 --> 29:33.590
You keep growing up, but my heart stays small. I'm sorry.

383
29:33.590 --> 29:38.002
Instead, Rule 1: Use good condoms.

384
29:38.002 --> 29:43.278
Rule 2: Go to checkups are a must. And with me!

385
29:43.278 --> 29:47.617
Rule 3: Do not marry Dong Woo.

386
29:48.226 --> 29:49.542
Deal!

387
29:49.542 --> 29:52.666
I'm sorry for upsetting you too, Mom.

388
29:52.666 --> 29:54.170
Reconciliation tteokbokki, deal?

389
29:54.170 --> 29:55.727
- I'm leaving early today. - What?

390
29:55.727 --> 29:58.337
I have to eat tteokbokki with my daughter.

391
29:59.414 --> 30:00.586
You want me to do all this alone?

392
30:00.586 --> 30:03.782
I covered all of this when you went to Ganghwado with your crush.

393
30:03.782 --> 30:05.966
Don't you remember?

394
30:07.261 --> 30:09.578
Tteokbokki...

395
30:09.578 --> 30:12.274
Grandma's Hand Tteokbokki in Hangdeok-dong is amazing.

396
30:12.274 --> 30:14.514
Exactly!

397
30:14.514 --> 30:16.306
I'm off!

398
30:27.090 --> 30:28.185
[You're all dead. I'm heading over right now!]

399
30:28.185 --> 30:33.022
[You think I'm joking? I'm coming to tear your office apart!]

400
30:50.486 --> 30:55.894
Excuse me, what brings you here?

401
30:56.598 --> 31:01.262
Sir, you need to tell me what this is regarding...

402
31:09.138 --> 31:11.382
The intensity is definitely on the stronger side.

403
31:11.382 --> 31:13.746
The grip isn't great, though.

404
31:13.746 --> 31:15.254
Was the date really that bad?

405
31:15.254 --> 31:17.028
The levels aren't refined either.

406
31:17.028 --> 31:18.146
It'll definitely come down to personal taste.

407
31:18.146 --> 31:21.661
Taste! I should've figured out her tastes.

408
31:21.661 --> 31:23.254
Dating requires strategy...

409
31:23.254 --> 31:26.258
Hey, just go home.

410
31:28.218 --> 31:30.210
What kind of guy is he?

411
31:30.210 --> 31:32.570
The guy Yeon Su likes.

412
31:32.570 --> 31:35.950
Innocent people like her usually end up falling for scumbags.

413
31:35.950 --> 31:37.498
She needs to be careful!

414
31:37.498 --> 31:40.598
Come on, is she an idiot without even that kind of judgment?

415
31:40.598 --> 31:44.050
They say judgment gets blurry in front of love, you know?

416
31:44.050 --> 31:46.153
All right, just get back to work.

417
31:49.958 --> 31:51.566
[Gong Yeon Su]

418
31:51.566 --> 31:54.366
The subscriber you dialed is unavailable, connecting to voicemail.

419
31:54.366 --> 31:57.497
After the beep, the call charges will apply.

420
31:58.458 --> 32:01.106
Hello, sir!

421
32:01.106 --> 32:05.374
Someone is here looking for you. I think it's Peter Panty...

422
32:09.091 --> 32:10.129
[Dokgo Dal, you have a new voicemail]

423
32:10.129 --> 32:11.648
[Press the call button to connect]

424
32:11.648 --> 32:13.396
First message.

425
32:13.396 --> 32:17.186
Hello, sir! Someone is here looking for you.

426
32:17.186 --> 32:18.536
I think it's Peter Panty...

427
32:18.536 --> 32:21.395
Sir, wait a second!

428
32:21.395 --> 32:23.398
Godal! Where are you going?

429
32:29.762 --> 32:33.366
You decorated this place nicely with my money.

430
32:35.246 --> 32:36.786
Before the CEO arrives,

431
32:36.786 --> 32:40.499
let me clarify a few things first.

432
32:44.250 --> 32:48.062
You are our customer Peter Panty, correct?

433
32:48.062 --> 32:52.058
You've posted forty-seven times on our board.

434
32:52.058 --> 32:54.482
Complaining the intensity is too weak to feel anything,

435
32:54.482 --> 32:57.886
that your wife got an electric shock while using it,

436
32:57.886 --> 33:00.734
along with various charging errors.

437
33:00.734 --> 33:01.950
- Listen here-- - First,

438
33:01.950 --> 33:04.806
our products are made of medical-grade silicone,

439
33:04.806 --> 33:06.482
making an internal electric shock impossible.

440
33:06.482 --> 33:10.150
Second, it clearly specifies the usage of standard charging,

441
33:10.150 --> 33:11.502
yet you used fast charging.

442
33:11.502 --> 33:12.757
That is user negligence.

443
33:12.757 --> 33:17.034
Third, if issues keep occurring every single time,

444
33:17.034 --> 33:19.962
why do you keep buying our products?

445
33:19.962 --> 33:23.046
You're currently in our top one percent of VIP customers.

446
33:23.046 --> 33:26.436
What's the revenue here? What's your operating profit?

447
33:30.486 --> 33:32.038
Regardless,

448
33:32.038 --> 33:34.323
threats cross the line.

449
33:34.323 --> 33:37.410
- Threats? - If you post threats to wreck our office,

450
33:37.410 --> 33:41.542
grab our CEO by the collar, or inflict physical harm again,

451
33:41.542 --> 33:45.146
we won't just stand by.

452
33:51.066 --> 33:52.254
What's your name, young lady?

453
33:52.254 --> 33:57.558
I'm not a young lady. I'm Gong Yeon Su from Marketing.

454
33:57.558 --> 33:58.842
Ms. Gong Yeon Su,

455
33:58.842 --> 34:04.142
I'm someone who can do whatever I want to that CEO.

456
34:04.142 --> 34:05.866
You don't have children, do you?

457
34:05.866 --> 34:08.010
Has it ever crossed your mind that the person you mistreat

458
34:08.010 --> 34:12.058
is someone else's precious son or daughter?

459
34:12.058 --> 34:13.893
Father!

460
34:16.246 --> 34:18.430
Father?

461
34:24.414 --> 34:26.646
What brings you here?

462
34:27.686 --> 34:31.063
How dare you drag me all the way here?

463
34:31.063 --> 34:32.998
I heard from Mr. Yoon.

464
34:32.998 --> 34:37.394
Humiliating me wasn't enough for you?

465
34:37.394 --> 34:42.470
How far do you have to drag your father down to be satisfied?

466
34:45.698 --> 34:47.768
- Wait outside. - I told you to marry

467
34:47.768 --> 34:49.306
and act like a decent human being,

468
34:49.306 --> 34:50.746
and you went to that family and claimed what?

469
34:50.746 --> 34:52.714
Azoospermia?

470
34:59.490 --> 35:01.932
I'll handle this.

471
35:10.170 --> 35:15.502
His father's rough around the edges, but he's not a bad man.

472
35:15.502 --> 35:20.098
Don't worry too much and just head back to your desk.

473
35:20.098 --> 35:22.002
No.

474
35:23.242 --> 35:25.126
I'll stay.

475
35:25.126 --> 35:27.030
I think I should be here.

476
35:27.030 --> 35:29.238
What do you think you're doing in someone's workplace?

477
35:29.238 --> 35:30.750
This is my company.

478
35:30.750 --> 35:32.914
Because this is all because of me.

479
35:32.914 --> 35:35.632
Are you embarrassed in front of your employee?

480
35:36.774 --> 35:39.070
Aren't you ashamed of making money selling this trash?

481
35:39.965 --> 35:41.310
Pathetic loser.

482
35:41.310 --> 35:43.678
You call this garbage a business?

483
35:43.678 --> 35:45.910
How long are you going to live like this?

484
35:45.910 --> 35:47.986
Who knows?

485
35:47.986 --> 35:50.786
- Did your life ever go as planned, Father? - What?

486
35:50.786 --> 35:53.386
You never spared a glance for your children your entire life.

487
35:53.386 --> 35:55.706
Why are you suddenly making such a fuss?

488
35:55.706 --> 35:58.026
Marry and act like a decent human being?

489
35:58.026 --> 36:02.594
So, did marrying four times make you a saint?

490
36:02.594 --> 36:05.804
- You insolent punk! - I'm not getting married.

491
36:20.762 --> 36:25.265
I don't want anyone getting dragged into my life.

492
36:30.366 --> 36:32.850
I don't want to hurt

493
36:32.850 --> 36:34.999
someone precious to me.

494
36:38.622 --> 36:40.998
Just like you hurt my mother.

495
36:40.998 --> 36:42.967
Now that Mr. Yoon knows, every match in this circle is ruined.

496
36:42.967 --> 36:44.260
Go clear things up with that family right now!

497
36:44.260 --> 36:45.970
What's done is done.

498
36:45.970 --> 36:47.102
You won't do it?

499
36:47.102 --> 36:49.678
Then I'll handle it myself.

500
36:49.678 --> 36:51.475
Father...

501
36:54.338 --> 36:56.418
Excuse me for interrupting.

502
36:56.418 --> 37:00.618
I believe I'm the one who should explain.

503
37:00.618 --> 37:02.462
Ms. Yeon Su.

504
37:10.886 --> 37:13.878
Mr. Dokgo Dal didn't do anything wrong.

505
37:13.878 --> 37:16.514
I asked him to do it.

506
37:16.514 --> 37:20.487
I asked him to shatter my family's expectations.

507
37:25.126 --> 37:27.446
Allow me to introduce myself properly.

508
37:27.446 --> 37:31.406
I'm the granddaughter of Gong Hyeon Dong,

509
37:31.406 --> 37:34.249
and Dokgo Dal's blind date,

510
37:34.249 --> 37:36.303
Gong Yeon Su.

511
37:43.986 --> 37:45.970
What on earth is going on here?

512
38:15.662 --> 38:18.127
I made an appointment at the clinic for next week.

513
38:19.966 --> 38:22.294
Get ready by then.

514
38:22.294 --> 38:24.259
Don't worry about the money.

515
38:27.138 --> 38:29.454
I'm just worried about you

516
38:29.454 --> 38:31.975
more than anything, Si Eun.

517
38:32.926 --> 38:35.834
Why are your hands so cold?

518
38:35.834 --> 38:38.454
Why is your hand scraped? Are you hurt?

519
38:38.454 --> 38:40.318
Si Eun.

520
38:43.778 --> 38:47.966
Is this really the best for us?

521
38:48.598 --> 38:50.368
What do you mean?

522
38:51.358 --> 38:53.329
I know,

523
38:55.402 --> 38:57.792
that I should respect your choice.

524
38:59.942 --> 39:02.213
But I keep getting greedy.

525
39:06.718 --> 39:09.442
Starting a family with you,

526
39:09.442 --> 39:13.266
and building a sweet life together.

527
39:16.218 --> 39:17.246
Nam Su...

528
39:17.246 --> 39:19.926
Like you said, I've spent my entire life without a backbone.

529
39:19.926 --> 39:23.638
Always doing as I was told, living as I was told to do.

530
39:23.638 --> 39:25.612
But, for the first time,

531
39:26.514 --> 39:29.657
I want to try living the life I want.

532
39:31.314 --> 39:34.079
I'm just telling you how I feel.

533
39:35.550 --> 39:37.662
I'm just

534
39:37.662 --> 39:39.608
saying it.

535
39:43.626 --> 39:46.586
So what if you found a life you want for once?

536
39:46.586 --> 39:50.094
What about money? Childcare? My career?

537
39:52.758 --> 39:54.582
I can't do it.

538
39:56.386 --> 39:58.236
I...

539
40:00.902 --> 40:03.608
I refuse to be a trial version in your life.

540
40:23.074 --> 40:25.370
I apologize for what happened today on his behalf.

541
40:25.370 --> 40:28.166
I should be the one apologizing.

542
40:28.166 --> 40:31.754
With your father's glare and intense aura,

543
40:31.754 --> 40:35.506
I really thought he was the furious Peter Panty.

544
40:37.242 --> 40:40.958
Didn't you put yourself in an awkward spot for no reason?

545
40:40.958 --> 40:43.189
I told you I'd handle it.

546
40:43.878 --> 40:47.944
It started because of me, so fixing it was the least I could do.

547
40:49.038 --> 40:52.846
Are you all right, though?

548
40:52.846 --> 40:56.661
Your father looked quite furious.

549
40:57.734 --> 41:00.134
No need to worry.

550
41:00.134 --> 41:03.886
He's a person who can only breathe when he controls everything,

551
41:03.886 --> 41:06.671
and I'm the only thing he can't control.

552
41:07.402 --> 41:09.674
And I happen to enjoy that.

553
41:14.778 --> 41:18.814
Then why do you keep going on blind dates?

554
41:18.814 --> 41:22.446
I said I won't get married, not that I won't go on dates.

555
41:27.634 --> 41:33.186
So, do you plan to keep going on blind dates?

556
41:33.186 --> 41:36.242
Maybe, if I'm tight on cash.

557
41:42.214 --> 41:45.126
I wish you wouldn't...

558
41:47.906 --> 41:49.102
What?

559
41:49.102 --> 41:51.090
Those dates.

560
41:52.274 --> 41:55.553
I wish you wouldn't go on them anymore.

561
42:01.842 --> 42:03.818
I...

562
42:03.818 --> 42:07.456
I like you, Dokgo Dal.

563
42:09.874 --> 42:13.181
Whether the physical came first or the emotional,

564
42:13.181 --> 42:15.442
I don't really know.

565
42:15.442 --> 42:17.909
But the reason is only one.

566
42:19.706 --> 42:24.457
When I'm with you, I discover sides of myself I never knew.

567
42:25.190 --> 42:30.229
It gives me courage to face things and change.

568
42:54.034 --> 42:55.858
I'm...

569
42:57.146 --> 43:01.160
not the one who can give you what you want, Yeon Su.

570
43:06.058 --> 43:11.562
You said you've never given your heart to anyone in your life, right?

571
43:15.378 --> 43:20.096
You're just afraid of hurting someone precious to you.

572
43:21.086 --> 43:24.642
It's a road we'll both regret after just a few steps.

573
43:24.642 --> 43:27.037
How do you know without even trying?

574
43:27.037 --> 43:29.455
I know without having to walk down it.

575
43:32.234 --> 43:34.035
I know

576
43:35.030 --> 43:37.071
myself too well.

577
44:28.290 --> 44:30.222
So,

578
44:30.222 --> 44:35.614
you're saying you can't give your heart to anyone?

579
44:35.614 --> 44:37.538
Then...

580
44:38.194 --> 44:40.250
does that mean

581
44:40.250 --> 44:44.180
only your body?

582
44:46.618 --> 44:49.827
Time to sleep. Gotta sleep.

583
45:18.114 --> 45:20.150
What the...

584
45:20.150 --> 45:25.082
Wait, 0-7-0... What?

585
45:29.978 --> 45:31.846
Jeez... you!

586
45:31.846 --> 45:34.658
Finally, it opened.

587
45:36.034 --> 45:38.210
It's finally open!

588
45:38.210 --> 45:40.002
What are you doing?

589
45:48.670 --> 45:51.014
If you're drunk, go to your own place. Why come to mine?

590
45:51.014 --> 45:53.542
Is there "my house" or "your house" between us?

591
45:53.542 --> 45:55.501
Just go to sleep.

592
45:56.366 --> 45:58.186
Godal.

593
46:02.274 --> 46:04.270
I figured it out.

594
46:04.270 --> 46:06.387
The guy Yeon Su likes.

595
46:17.450 --> 46:19.859
Must be nice, darn it...

596
46:23.682 --> 46:27.754
Why you and not me? Huh? Why you?

597
46:27.754 --> 46:32.788
I'm way sweeter, cuter, and a better cook, so why you?

598
46:34.518 --> 46:38.782
In my life, I never imagined I'd have a headache over a woman because of you!

599
46:38.782 --> 46:40.701
What did I say?

600
46:40.701 --> 46:43.976
Didn't I say innocent girls fall for scumbags?

601
46:47.294 --> 46:51.394
Godal, I love you!

602
46:51.394 --> 46:54.707
But I really like Yeon Su.

603
46:57.798 --> 47:00.070
So make a choice...

604
47:00.070 --> 47:02.143
- About what? - If you're serious about Yeon Su,

605
47:02.143 --> 47:03.814
treat her properly!

606
47:03.814 --> 47:05.914
If not, draw a clear line!

607
47:05.914 --> 47:08.199
Don't go breaking her heart!

608
47:13.242 --> 47:15.122
I'm asking you only once.

609
47:16.658 --> 47:18.454
Do you

610
47:20.674 --> 47:22.571
like Gong Yeon Su?

611
47:29.806 --> 47:34.867
I need an answer, so I know whether to move on or not!

612
47:39.934 --> 47:41.882
Move on.

613
47:53.330 --> 47:55.329
I'm sorry.

614
48:12.826 --> 48:15.506
Good morning.

615
48:15.506 --> 48:17.394
Morning.

616
48:20.598 --> 48:21.618
Can I drink this?

617
48:21.618 --> 48:24.442
Sure. Goodness, what happened to you?

618
48:25.578 --> 48:27.662
I drank a bit too much yesterday.

619
48:27.662 --> 48:29.158
Where's Ms. Yeon Su?

620
48:29.158 --> 48:32.206
She said she had something to do and would be late today.

621
48:32.206 --> 48:34.176
Oh, jackpot!

622
48:36.058 --> 48:38.910
Looks like Ms. Gong might be heading back to SR Planning.

623
48:38.910 --> 48:40.854
- What? - What are you talking about?

624
48:40.854 --> 48:45.058
Think about it! Her contract's almost up and the project is wrapped.

625
48:45.058 --> 48:46.942
Doesn't that mean she's wrapping things up here?

626
48:46.942 --> 48:51.590
No way! The pop-up was a hit and things are great. Why so suddenly?

627
48:51.590 --> 48:54.363
Did you hear something, by any chance?

628
48:56.474 --> 48:58.918
Just when the branding was finally gaining traction,

629
48:58.918 --> 49:00.638
is she upset with us about something?

630
49:00.638 --> 49:02.306
Wait!

631
49:02.306 --> 49:03.634
How do you even know this?

632
49:03.634 --> 49:07.033
Well, I have my own exclusive network system.

633
49:07.033 --> 49:09.270
Is this actually reliable?

634
49:09.270 --> 49:11.874
Totally! She's at SR Planning right now!

635
49:11.874 --> 49:14.783
Apparently, they called an emergency meeting!

636
49:18.454 --> 49:21.662
So, you want to compromise?

637
49:21.662 --> 49:24.554
There's no need to necessarily start with a heavy romance, right?

638
49:24.554 --> 49:27.698
We can take things slow, flirt, and grow closer.

639
49:27.698 --> 49:32.042
Have meals, grab coffee, talk on the phone at night...

640
49:32.042 --> 49:34.150
And have sex?

641
49:34.150 --> 49:37.134
That... comes after making it official.

642
49:37.134 --> 49:39.162
What if he refuses to date?

643
49:39.162 --> 49:41.170
- Huh? - Say he likes you,

644
49:41.170 --> 49:44.570
but doesn't want a relationship and only wants sex. What then?

645
49:47.570 --> 49:48.662
Then...

646
49:48.662 --> 49:52.363
Can you really cut him off completely after sleeping with him?

647
49:53.310 --> 49:56.842
The moment you started liking him, you were already reeled in.

648
49:56.842 --> 49:59.626
You know what kind of guy he is better than anyone.

649
49:59.626 --> 50:03.566
Don't expect romance for nothing and get hurt, think carefully.

650
50:03.566 --> 50:07.114
If you're ready to dive in headfirst, come what may, go for it.

651
50:07.114 --> 50:09.350
If you don't have the courage or confidence to start,

652
50:09.350 --> 50:11.130
stop!

653
50:22.474 --> 50:23.750
Hello?

654
50:23.750 --> 50:25.842
Are you the guardian of Gong Nam Su?

655
50:25.842 --> 50:27.498
Yes, I am. Who's calling?

656
50:27.498 --> 50:29.706
This is the emergency room at Seojung Hospital.

657
50:29.706 --> 50:31.535
What?

658
50:38.434 --> 50:41.012
I'm the guardian of patient Gong Nam Su.

659
50:41.012 --> 50:43.594
One moment. Please head over that way.

660
50:43.594 --> 50:45.457
Thank you!

661
50:49.474 --> 50:51.394
Yeon Su.

662
50:51.394 --> 50:53.106
Nam Su!

663
50:53.106 --> 50:55.590
You brainless idiot. You moron!

664
50:55.590 --> 50:57.195
- You fool! - Ow! That hurts!

665
50:57.195 --> 50:58.430
Jeez, that stings!

666
50:58.430 --> 51:03.514
You! Let's tell our family first.

667
51:03.514 --> 51:05.730
- No! No, absolutely not! - Hey!

668
51:05.730 --> 51:07.530
Why?

669
51:08.158 --> 51:11.357
I'm... discussing it with Si Eun first.

670
51:16.906 --> 51:18.978
Since when have you been doing this job?

671
51:18.978 --> 51:20.210
Not that long.

672
51:20.210 --> 51:23.438
What about your classes? Did you quit?

673
51:23.438 --> 51:26.658
Aren't you taking the civil service exam?

674
51:26.658 --> 51:28.514
I will... eventually.

675
51:28.514 --> 51:31.922
You crazy idiot! Why on earth didn't you use a condom?

676
51:31.922 --> 51:34.438
Keep your voice down! That's so embarrassing!

677
51:34.438 --> 51:36.266
Are you Gong Nam Su's guardian?

678
51:36.266 --> 51:38.018
- Yes, I am. - Just a moment.

679
51:38.018 --> 51:39.766
Yes.

680
51:40.370 --> 51:43.365
You! Don't you dare move!

681
51:45.894 --> 51:48.070
Ouch, that hurts!

682
51:54.795 --> 51:57.430
[Dokgo Dal]

683
51:59.578 --> 52:01.654
Mr. Dal! It's Nam Su.

684
52:01.654 --> 52:03.274
Why are you answering your sister's phone?

685
52:03.274 --> 52:07.534
She left it with me. We're in the ER right now.

686
52:07.534 --> 52:08.650
The ER?

687
52:08.650 --> 52:12.887
Yeah, the accident turned out worse than expected...

688
52:13.954 --> 52:17.308
Where are you? Which hospital?

689
52:18.754 --> 52:20.142
Sorry, I can barely hear you...

690
52:20.142 --> 52:22.388
We're at Seojung Hospital!

691
52:23.530 --> 52:28.002
Don't worry, though. My legs are made of steel.

692
52:28.002 --> 52:30.010
Hello?

693
52:30.010 --> 52:32.502
Hey, do you have private health insurance?

694
52:32.502 --> 52:34.054
- It's pricier than I thought! - Yeon Su,

695
52:34.054 --> 52:35.122
that guy called.

696
52:35.122 --> 52:36.726
- Who? - Mr. Dokgo.

697
52:36.726 --> 52:38.880
Really? Why would he call?

698
52:38.880 --> 52:40.173
Nam Su!

699
52:40.173 --> 52:41.338
Si Eun!

700
52:41.338 --> 52:44.026
Oh no, look at you... You're all scraped up!

701
52:44.026 --> 52:45.462
What did they say about your leg?

702
52:45.462 --> 52:47.822
Why did you do this?

703
52:47.822 --> 52:50.298
You should've told me!

704
52:50.298 --> 52:54.521
Did you eat? How's your stomach? Your hands are freezing!

705
52:54.521 --> 52:57.626
My heart aches! I'm worried sick about you.

706
52:57.626 --> 52:59.866
What are we going to do?

707
52:59.866 --> 53:03.634
It hurts here, and it hurts here too.

708
53:03.634 --> 53:04.652
And right here.

709
53:04.652 --> 53:08.254
Let me see. You're scraped here too...

710
53:08.254 --> 53:10.726
- Hey guys, I'm right here... - Oh, no!

711
53:13.421 --> 53:17.084
It's all scraped. You're breaking my heart!

712
53:18.634 --> 53:22.902
No wonder she's pregnant. That idiot.

713
53:22.902 --> 53:27.661
People who don't use condoms deserve to get fined.

714
53:33.176 --> 53:34.969
[Gong Yeon Su]

715
53:41.860 --> 53:43.653
You should watch where you're going.

716
53:43.653 --> 53:46.865
Ms. Gong! Ms. Gong!

717
53:46.865 --> 53:49.817
What were you thinking driving like this in a crosswalk?

718
54:03.298 --> 54:05.365
Wait...

719
54:06.906 --> 54:08.669
Are you okay?

720
54:10.466 --> 54:12.098
Any other injuries beside your leg?

721
54:12.098 --> 54:14.829
What are you doing here, Mr. Dal?

722
54:14.829 --> 54:17.836
Why am I here?

723
54:19.118 --> 54:22.802
There was an accident outside the hospital entrance.

724
54:22.802 --> 54:26.162
A car bumped into you slightly

725
54:26.162 --> 54:27.846
and you fainted from shock.

726
54:27.846 --> 54:29.634
What?

727
54:31.030 --> 54:34.458
When your brother answered, I thought you were the one injured.

728
54:34.458 --> 54:38.878
I rushed over in a panic... I'm so sorry.

729
54:40.039 --> 54:42.945
Why are you apologizing?

730
54:44.414 --> 54:48.330
I was the one who hit you.

731
54:52.590 --> 54:59.062
- Just make sure the insurance handles it. - Right.

732
54:59.946 --> 55:05.098
By the way, why did you call me earlier?

733
55:05.098 --> 55:07.094
Well...

734
55:07.094 --> 55:09.894
I definitely had something to say,

735
55:09.894 --> 55:11.849
but I completely forgot it now.

736
55:14.690 --> 55:18.272
I'm the one who got hit, so why did you lose your memory?

737
55:21.662 --> 55:24.962
Just kidding! I'm only joking!

738
55:37.642 --> 55:40.990
I don't have the confidence

739
55:40.990 --> 55:42.921
to be a good person to someone.

740
55:44.714 --> 55:46.967
I'm bad at expressing myself,

741
55:48.102 --> 55:50.578
and I'm emotionally numb.

742
55:50.578 --> 55:52.314
So chances are...

743
55:54.334 --> 55:56.910
I'll disappoint you a lot.

744
55:59.226 --> 56:02.098
If you're okay with that...

745
56:02.098 --> 56:03.951
I'm in!

746
56:06.418 --> 56:08.205
Let's do it!

747
56:09.526 --> 56:11.291
Friends!

748
56:13.474 --> 56:17.318
Friends?

749
56:26.214 --> 56:28.876
FWB.

750
56:28.876 --> 56:30.002
Clear the way!

751
56:30.002 --> 56:31.626
- Out of the way! - Cardiac arrest!

752
56:31.626 --> 56:33.766
- Cardiac arrest! - Please move!

753
56:33.766 --> 56:35.470
Let us pass!

754
56:40.470 --> 56:42.306
What?

755
56:42.306 --> 56:45.406
Friends with benefits!
